---
import "@fontsource-variable/inter";
import "~/styles/index.css";
import Header from "~/components/header.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Draft terms | Lexus IS250C Car Share</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-full bg-default text-default">
    <Header />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-20 pt-32">
      <p class="mb-6 rounded border border-amber-400 bg-amber-100 p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Draft for review only. These terms are incomplete, are not in force, and cannot be accepted yet.</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Draft rental and ETC terms</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Booking and payment</h2><p class="mt-2">A request does not guarantee availability. The operator reviews the request and provides the price, payment deadline and applicable terms. A booking is confirmed only after the request is approved and payment is confirmed. The operator's legal details and contact information are to be confirmed.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Prices and booking period</h2><p class="mt-2">The proposed prices for 1–31 days are listed on the booking page. For 32 days or longer, request a quote. The applicable total, the meaning of a rental day, taxes, insurance, other charges, and pickup and return times are to be confirmed before payment.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Driver eligibility</h2><p class="mt-2">Each driver must be legally entitled to drive the vehicle in Japan and meet the operator's eligibility requirements. Licence and identity documents must be checked as required, including originals at pickup. Additional driver requirements are to be confirmed. Please do not send document images or numbers through the preview form.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. ETC and toll charges</h2><p class="mt-2">ETC availability and conditions are to be confirmed. If ETC is requested, the standard toll advance is ¥10,000, separate from the rental price. The amount may be adjusted according to the planned destinations and booking length. Planned destinations are optional and can be undecided. The final amount, payment method, settlement and refund conditions must be agreed before payment.</p><p class="mt-3">Toll records and final charges may be delayed and may become available after the vehicle is returned. Once the relevant charges have been confirmed, the operator will provide an itemized settlement. Any unused advance will be refunded under the agreed conditions; if charges exceed the advance, the operator will provide details and request the difference under the agreed conditions. The expected timing and how delays will be communicated are to be agreed before payment. An advance is not a cap on toll charges.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Insurance, damage and incidents</h2><p class="mt-2">Insurance coverage, eligible drivers, exclusions, deductibles, accident and breakdown procedures, liability, and required notifications are not yet determined and must be provided before booking.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Cancellation and return</h2><p class="mt-2">Cancellation, no-show, refund, extension, late return, fuel and pickup or return procedures are not yet determined and must be provided before booking.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Personal information</h2><p class="mt-2">The operator's privacy notice, purposes of use, storage and retention periods, security measures, and contact details are to be provided before collecting requests. Do not enter card details, licence numbers or document images into this preview.</p></section>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-10"><a href="/en/booking/" class="font-semibold underline">Back to booking preview</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
